                <div
                    class="text-sm faq-item-body text-gray-600"
                ><div class="text-option">&#8203;<span style="color:rgb(88, 87, 94)">Before you plant a tree or install a fence or build or install anything that might interfere with a&nbsp;</span><span style="color:rgb(88, 87, 94)">buried utility, you must submit a dig ticket. This submission can be made at&nbsp;</span><a href="http://www.kentucky811.org/" target="_blank">www.kentucky811.org</a><span style="color:rgb(88, 87, 94)">. Your buried utilities will be marked for the benefit of you and/or your&nbsp;</span><span style="color:rgb(88, 87, 94)">contractor.</span></div></div>
